\title{ecoeval: Evaluate AI Extraction Accuracy Against a Human Gold Standard}
\description{
Provides an interactive Shiny dashboard for measuring how accurately an AI extraction pipeline performed against a human-curated gold standard. Because two readers describe the same finding differently, records must be aligned before they can be compared; ecoeval pairs records using probabilistic record linkage, resolves near-matches with a cascade of comparators ending in an LLM judge, and reports precision, recall, and field-level accuracy. Designed to be run iteratively, surfacing signals that distinguish model error from schema misfit.
}
